{"seq":3,"slug":"linear-applications","title":"八年级数学 — 一次函数应用","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-8/mathematics/linear-functions/linear-applications","wordCount":1607,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"八年级数学-一次函数应用\">八年级数学 — 一次函数应用</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>一次函数的应用是将函数知识与实际问题相结合的重要环节。通过建立一次函数模型，可以描述匀速运动、费用计算、利润分析等现实场景中的线性关系，并利用函数的性质进行预测和决策。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>应用类型</th>\n<th>典型场景</th>\n<th>建模方法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>行程问题</td>\n<td>匀速运动、追及、相遇</td>\n<td>s = vt + <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>费用问题</td>\n<td>通信资费、出租车计费</td>\n<td>y = kx + b（分段）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>利润问题</td>\n<td>定价、销量、利润关系</td>\n<td>利润 = 售价 × 销量 - 成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>方案选择</td>\n<td>比较两种方案的优劣</td>\n<td>建立两个函数，求交点分段比较</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>解决一次函数应用题的基本步骤：审题找变量→建立函数关系→确定取值范围→求解问题→检验结果。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"行程问题中的一次函数\">行程问题中的一次函数</h3><p>匀速运动是最典型的一次函数模型。设物体运动速度为 v，初始位置为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则 t 时刻的位置为 s = vt + <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p><strong>追及问题</strong>：甲在乙前方，甲速度小于乙，问乙何时追上甲。设甲的位置函数为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> = <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span><